  "releaseNotes": "Unit properties that refuse no value are marked required\nBuild requested candle series with calendar bounds and accurate source updates\nLocalize public core enum captions with Display resources\nCarry the order's own id on its registration\nName the overload a doc comment of the order book holder refers to\nFold an order book change without stating the whole book it leaves\nName boards and board states in words\nUnwind the blocking waits left by the async rework and fix what it uncovered\nAdd walk-forward optimization, a market profile, three statistics and candle spread options\nMove instrument lookups and persistence to async\nAnswer an unsubscribe that arrives after the connection ended\nUpdated Ecng.Linq to 1.0.194.\nUpdated Ecng.Logging to 1.0.203.",
